<title>USA: USDA offers Poland $5 mln under GSM-103 for FY97.</title>
<headline>USDA offers Poland $5 mln under GSM-103 for FY97.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department authorized $5 million in credit guarantees for sales of farm goods to Poland under the Intermediate Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-103) for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>USDA allocated the entire $5 million for breeder livestock.</p>
<p>It said beginning Oct 1, exporters may apply for credit guarantees.</p>
